          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतिबंध करणे — pratibandh karṇe — \"to prevent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्वच्छतेमुळे आजारांना प्रतिबंध करता येतो. svacchatemuḷe ājārānnā pratibandh kartā yeto. Cleanliness can prevent illness."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने प्रतिबंध केला, tyāne pratibandh kelā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is prevented takes -ला; प्रतिबंधक, preventive."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतिबंध करणे (pratibandh karṇe) joins the tatsama प्रतिबंध, Sanskrit pratibandha, \"connexion, hindrance\" (CDIAL 8580), to करणे, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
