            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या नियमात एक पळवाट आहे. yā niymāt ek paḷvāṭ āhe. There is a loophole in this rule."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पळ + वाट, flight + path; पळवाट (paḷvāṭ) काढणे, to find a way out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
